{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52791","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 崔璘","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轩冕朝恩盛，霓裳祖帐荣。\n倐然谢时客，高步尚遗名。\n魏阙鸳行断，稽山鹤驾迎。\n相期下凫舄，谒帝会承明。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔璘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52791.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52791","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}